WEBVTT

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:07.220
So that's how the DarkSteel Sword Set is supposed to be?

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:12.420
Yes indeed. The Reiken Sect named itself after
the sword, so of course a sword set is their forte.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.120
But I don't think I can do it again.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:18.730
Your rage is depleted huh?

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:21.580
Emotions are a source of power,

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.230
thus cultivation is also of one's heart.

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:30.630
One can control their emotions at will,
and learn to use it as an edge in a fight.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:36.390
Wow, you're really learned.
You know so many things!

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:41.180
Didn't you also learn about
the Ethereal Heart at Ethereal Peak?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.810
Pay attention in class!

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.730
Well then, let's try again.

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:50.320
Now that I know you're intentionally
doing it, I won't get angry.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:53.030
Don't worry, that won't be a problem.

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.530
There's a really easy way to force it,
unless you're a masochist.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:57.530
What?

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:58.070
Punch!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:05.530
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:27.100
Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:35.660
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:42.360
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:45.880
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:53.040
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:58.750
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:03.100
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:09.040
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:13.370
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.410
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:20.590
whose name we've yet to know

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:34.300
I learned a lot today.

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:38.050
<i>Fatty's been dealing a lot
more damage than expected.</i>

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:43.810
<i>It's only been several hours, but he's already used
the Darksteel Sword SKill Set at least 20 times.</i>

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:51.020
<i>I tried to take a direct blow,
but the pain was excruciating.</i>

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.520
<i>It was as if all my bones started to melt.</i>

00:02:54.360 --> 00:03:02.780
<i>At the same time, I could feel
the strengthening pill begin to take effect.</i>

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:07.080
<i>I felt a chill from the core of my bones.</i>

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:11.580
I knew then, that it had enabled me to grow stronger.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:17.100
<i>This must be proof that I've made it to the 8th stage of Amorphic Bones.</i>

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:20.700
<i>I guess this the "rock hard"
my teacher was referring to.</i>

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.660
You dumbass!

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:47.490
Since when did you stoop so low that
you're peeping on a lady's sleep!?

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:53.000
My teacher told me I can check my cultivation
progress if I use Inner Observance.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.390
Did you hear what I just said?

00:03:54.390 --> 00:04:00.230
Inner Observance is something even
a normal martial artist can do right?

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:03.510
Fine, I'll take a look.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:08.680
I was kinda curious about how you and
your Void Spirit Base were doing anyway.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:14.020
I just sent ki into your body.

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:19.340
Circulate it and try to stimulate various meridian points.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.730
Sync your breath with mine.

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:28.450
What do you see?

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.710
Paths.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.200
A great number of paths.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.690
Where are they leading?

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:42.970
They extend quite far, beyond what I can see.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:47.860
Those paths are your meridian lines.

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:49.380
Really?

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.970
It's natural that you can't see
much farther at this point.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:56.610
When I try to walk along one of the paths,

00:04:56.610 --> 00:05:00.160
I always seem to follow a branch that
takes me back to where I started.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.990
It's all thanks to the medicinal baths
that you've so many branches.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:07.370
Two years ago, there wasn't even a single path.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:11.540
You should be able to circulate ki throughout the branches,
once you've fully built up these meridian lines.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:16.420
I see, so this is Inner Observance.

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:18.240
Feeling exhausted?

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:23.970
Well, this is your first time after all,
it does take a lot out of you.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.290
I know what you mean! For the first time
it's only natural that I can't hold out very long.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:29.470
Please look forward to my second time.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.220
What the heck are you implying!?

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:36.690
Before they knew it, one month had passed.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.900
<i>Fatty's Darksteel Skill Set has improved so much,</i>

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:47.030
<i>I can barely keep up just using the Cloud Sword Skill Set.</i>

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:51.660
<i>But I've also improved a great deal, thanks to him.</i>

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.110
Can't block that!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.670
Look how masochistic I've become, to practice to the point where both my arms are fractured.

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:08.390
Why are you so happy.

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:13.430
The harder the blow, the more I can utilize that pill.

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:20.320
Your version of Amorphic Bones really is masochistic.

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:24.220
Not surprising, since its creator
is the sadistic Obu, I guess.

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:28.950
Hey, let's try Inner Observance again.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:34.660
You've been training it for a month now.
I bet you'll be able to see a lot more.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.920
At the end of the paths...

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:52.180
There are tens—no, hundreds
of rising pillars that can be seen.

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:57.180
Some of them flicker with a golden color.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:05.380
Those pillars are your bones,
and the flickering is the proof of your progress.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:08.270
Now I get it. My teacher mentioned in the guide that,

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:14.580
"You reach the end of the 8th stage when
all 200 of your bones are flickering."

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:20.330
I remember Obu said you can start ki gathering
after you've mastered the 8th stage.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:24.340
The Amorphic Bones really did allow
your Void Spirit Base to work.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:30.050
I hope it'll be as easy as you make it seem.
As of now, there are only 4 or 5 pillars flickering.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:35.550
What? That's so boring.
I thought I'd see something more exciting.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:41.560
Well, training has been kinda dull as of late.

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:47.480
That's it! I've got an idea to mix things up a bit.

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:49.990
You want to open chains?

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:53.250
We've worked hard for the past two years.

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:56.370
But we won't be able to make a difference like this.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:08:04.710
Since we've given up on cultivation, the only way
to prove our worth to our families is to succeed financially!

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:07.290
Please give us your permission.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:14.800
Oriku-san, I'll try my best today as usual.

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:18.810
No need to rush, let's get some good stuff to eat, first.

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:21.800
Today is Aya's day off!

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:24.180
I said good food, didn't I?

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:26.810
You mean the cafeteria for outer
court disciples at Ethereal Peak?

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.310
The food at that cafeteria sucks too.

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:31.490
Let's leave the mountain.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:36.490
There's good food at the bottom of the mountain?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.990
I'm gonna take you to meet some girls.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:45.400
Y-You mean it? I'm only a 14 year old boy...

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:50.500
Don't you think it's still too early?
Are you sure it's okay?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:09:01.860
Noo! I'm not going to this shop just to get
ripped off again! The innkeeper is way too scary!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.880
Quit struggling, damn Fatty!

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:03.930
Rei-san!

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:07.470
Closed?

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:08.940
What's all the fuss about?

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:11.400
The Inn's gonna be closed for a while.

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:12.580
Yo!

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.400
Oh, you've brought some pig meat to cook?

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:18.240
Do you remember what I said last time?

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.330
Let's discuss the details while we eat.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.750
Huh? Only noodles? Where's the meat?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.950
Since the inn is closed,
we just don't have the supplies.

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:32.170
If you don't like it, don't eat it.

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.420
So, what are we discussing again?

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:39.430
The best way to spice up training is real combat.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:42.060
So I think we should head to Azure Cloud Peak again.

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:45.070
Who'll be our leader?

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:47.980
No need for a leader, just the three of us.

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:54.990
We'll enter in Challenge mode. If we survive
we'll earn tons of challenge points.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:58.320
I don't think I'll survive.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:02.660
You know, I saw the Gaku sisters a few days ago.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.500
I told them they're both so cute,
so they must have boyfriends.

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:11.300
No, but I like the kind that challenges
and pushes themselves to the limit.

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:13.710
Me too, and I'd like someone who's funny.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:18.360
I'm gonna challenge my limits now!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.720
You're so cool, Bun-sama.

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:27.580
Well sorry but, there's no point in me going.
It's not like I need the challenge points.

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:29.340
Besides, I've got an inn to run.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:31.610
Isn't it closed for the time being?

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:37.600
I remember we left tons of divine grass
and medicinal materials lying around.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:40.870
You'd get a year's worth of revenue
just by picking 10 of 'em.

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:45.290
I'm moved by your challenging spirit, I'm down!

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:57.550
What type of practice did you do,
that the whole arena is ruined!?

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:57.550
Now that we're forbidden from using the arena...

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:04.450
Togen Village is gone!

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.260
Don't you think it'll be a perfect place to practice?

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:09.060
But where did Togen Village go?

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:14.060
I'm moved by your challenging spirit, I'm down!

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:16.570
Your eyes betray your true intentions.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:21.160
Alright then, let's head out after a week's time.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:24.200
A week? Why the delay?

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:28.910
My Amorphic Bones is nearing
the end of the 8th stage.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:34.420
I want to make sure you're there to protect me,
so I can breakthrough safely.

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:36.980
Protect you?

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:43.160
Obu wrote in the guide, that my body will
experience immense change when I breakthrough.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:46.430
So it'd be good to have someone
with strong inner ki look out for me.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.680
So that's why you need me there.

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:50.130
You got it.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:52.350
Looks like I'll be in your debt again.

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:57.230
Well, I'm looking forward to seeing your
new version of Amorphic Bones too.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:58.990
It'd be my pleasure to help out.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:01.570
But we have one problem...

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.360
A problem?

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.740
Stop coming to my room at midnight, when I'm asleep!

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:15.590
Oriku stayed in the VIP room of
the Ryoka Inn for the next five days,

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:18.880
preparing his body for the breakthrough.

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:25.390
All 200 bones are flickering.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:31.130
What I need to do now is sync the timing of the flickers.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.270
And see what happens.

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:44.030
It's pretty hard to sync them all,
so I don't know how long it'll take.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:46.330
I'll just have to do my best.

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:03.670
O-Oriku!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:09.680
A new flicker has appeared in
the center of the darkness!

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:17.020
As soon as the 200 came together, a new one was born.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:21.790
Its light is illuminating all the darkness.

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:31.000
Just like the breath of new life.

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:36.280
I see, it's not something random.

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:41.670
It's the amorphic bone I created by syncing the timing.

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:49.180
It hurts...Every time it flickers.

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:54.730
I've never experienced pain like this before.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:14:06.550
This newborn bone is trying to force
the other bones to match its rhythm.

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:14.700
It's trying to take control of my body!

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.340
Are you okay?

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:33.510
Thanks for helping me deal with the mutiny.

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:37.600
Guess I'll need to award you with
an official title of knighthood.

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:43.360
Looks like the medicinal baths
have really toughened you up.

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:49.640
Challenge mode? Without a leader?

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:53.280
Quit kidding around, who do you think you are?

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:57.720
What, didn't I write it down in the profile?

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.790
Oriku, legacy disciple of the Amorphic Peak.

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:05.940
I know that, the miracle legacy
disciple from 2 years ago.

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:12.550
Doesn't matter, the rules call for a leader.

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:18.270
Don't think you can use your title to boss people around at Spirit Lake Peak.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:22.460
Calm down, you misunderstood.

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:25.760
I have no intention to disobey the rules.

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:27.820
I'll be the leader.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.240
All you need to do is put your seal here...

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:38.000
The rules clearly specify that the leader needs to be
at tier 6 of the Ki Gathering Stage, at the least!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:42.330
And you're only at the Kinesthetic Stage.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:46.180
I see that you're well acquainted with the rules.

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:50.690
But you're not as thorough as me,
the nerdiest disciple of the Reiken Sect!

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:53.910
According to the 3rd chapter, 14th article,
3rd paragraph of management policy,

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:58.180
there is no stage requirement for
a leader in challenge mode.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:02.400
This is pointless, you're too young
to argue about rules with me.

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:06.520
To apply for a challenge mode, one needs permission from
a faculty member at a rank no lower than a hall master!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:10.690
Then take a look at this seal that belongs
to the elder of the Heavenly Sword Hall.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:13.160
What? You've got to be kidding me.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:19.080
If the chief can forgot his glasses,
my teacher can forget her seal at home.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:21.580
You want to boss me around with the title of an elder?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.830
That's right, is there a problem?

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:29.340
Why'd you even bother to
challenge me in the first place?

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:33.850
<i>Now all I have to do is write the names of the participants, on this form.</i>

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:37.850
<i>Then we'll be able to bypass the Spell
of Decree and enter the mountain.</i>

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:42.410
<i>Shoot, I forgot one important detail.</i>

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.600
<i>I don't know Rei's full name.</i>

00:16:45.090 --> 00:16:52.490
<i>She's been taking care of me these past two years.
How rude of me to have never asked for her full name.</i>

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:58.210
<i>Obu called her Rei-chan, but that's just a nickname.</i>

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:00.990
<i>Well, I'll ask her this time.</i>

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.380
There you are!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:07.580
Yo!

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:12.550
Hurry up, I can't wait to go into the mountains.

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:16.730
<i>She's only an innkeeper, but she can come
and go from the Reiken Sect as she pleases.</i>

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:19.050
<i>Rei is definitely no ordinary person.</i>

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:26.470
Before going in, we need to put our full names on this permission form,

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:32.790
given by the Office of Divine
Tactics, in Spirit Lake Peak.

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.210
Just "Rei" is fine.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:36.440
Rei? What's the surname?

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.490
No surname, how cool is that.

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:44.500
For real? This is Truth Paper, it won't
work if you don't put your real name.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:49.420
Don't worry, unlike your teacher, I'm not a liar.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:59.430
<i>A martial arts master shouldn't just be using a pet name.</i>

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:03.680
<i>How about taking my surname? Make it Osho Rei.</i>

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:19.280
Can't believe it's been already 3 years.
The 7th Elder must've learned a lot this time.

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:23.340
I hope he managed a breakthrough.

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:27.080
Judging from this cloud control alone, he must already be at the top of Nascent Soul.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:34.090
100 years ago, no one expected him to come this far.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:40.270
Indeed. 100 years ago, except for Chief,
no one had much hope in him.

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:42.350
But boy, were we wrong.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:51.360
Frankly I also had my doubts. The only one
that really believed in him, was Obu.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.630
7th Elder, you must be tired from your travels.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:15.630
Chief, Elder Ryuken, and even Elder Hokaku!

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:20.510
You didn't need to wait out for me like this.

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:27.970
Other elders would've also been here, but they are
unfortunately occupied with other pressing matters.

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.810
I'm really humbled.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:33.430
Elder Kaun is preparing a party for you.

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:34.700
But I—

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:39.320
Don't worry. Just like you said, nothing too flashy.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:43.760
But please, do tell us about your travels.

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:47.310
You traveled around from east to west right?

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.450
Did you find your family?

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:53.140
I didn't keep my hopes too high.

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:57.340
A small tribe like that is unlikely
to survive for more than 50 years.

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:01.760
But I did manage to meet many of the same tribe.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:05.850
They managed to survive on,
despite the poor conditions.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:14.730
Not everyone can be as lucky as me,
meeting people like Obu and all of you.

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:20.400
Ah, sorry for the gloomy tale!

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:26.410
Now I can finally return Azure Cloud Peak to you.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.880
I'm so sorry I wasn't able to manage it well.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:35.920
That thing with Elder Obu? Don't worry about it.

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:41.050
Looks like someone else entered in.

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:46.180
Rei?! Why is she there?

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:48.930
And with Oriku no less!

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:57.880
Oriku you brat!

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:01.030
Oriku, that genius legacy disciple?

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.520
Well they just entered.

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:05.610
7th Elder you haven't heard about it yet...

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:12.640
In recent years, my Stellar Daien Clairvoyance has reached
the point where I can see things in the near future.

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:14.790
There are various possibilities presented,

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:18.540
but without the filter of my Kunlun Glasses,
there's just too many to decipher between.

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:23.400
It's hard to figure out which
ones will actually take place.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:28.510
What I just saw were things that could
happen while Rei is on the mountain.

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:31.680
Why did you train such an obscure technique?

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:39.440
7th Elder, think about the possibilities
if the chief were to perfect this technique.

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:44.740
In battles, he could anticipate his opponent's
next move and think in advance.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:47.760
That would mean invincibility!

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:51.990
Even against true gods, nothing
could be done against him.

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:55.070
Easier said than done.

00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:59.170
Even after all these years,
I still can't make out clear shapes.

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:00.590
Wait for me.

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:01.940
I’ve brought the money.

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:04.040
I got my money ready.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:23.740
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:27.210
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:29.050
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:35.070
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:40.470
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:51.320
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:57.760
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:01.490
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:04.690
oh so powerfully

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:10.250
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:15.840
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:16.100 --> 00:23:25.940
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:37.580
"The Girl Sacrificed".

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:39.390
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
